@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Query the most recent logs
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs?limit=100

### Query with combinable filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs?service=checkout&level=error&since=2026-07-20T14:00:00Z&until=2026-07-20T15:00:00Z&attr.user_id=42&q=declined&limit=10

### Cursor pagination
### Replace the value below with next_cursor from a previous GET /logs response.
@cursor = paste-next-cursor-here
GET {{baseUrl}}/logs?limit=10&cursor={{cursor}}
